                                    [id] => 325
                                    [name] => N-171 - 3 Day - Jaipur (D1 Arr ex.AGR/SMP - D2 City+Amber - D3 Blank)
                                    [event_id] => 171
                                    [description] => <p>Drive to Jaipur by a private&nbsp;chauffeur-driven vehicle.</p>
<p><em><strong>Jaipur</strong>, Rajasthan\'s renowned walled capital  city, is also known as the  \"Pink City.\" This nickname originates from  the city painted pink in 1876  as a symbol of the locals\' warm welcome  to the visit of Queen Victoria  of England and the Prince of Wales.</em></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>MORNING: TOUR OF JAIPUR CITY AND AMBER FORT </strong></li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Today spend day in Jaipur exploring the impressive forts, majestic   castles, vibrant local bazaars, local souvenirs and experience real   India.</p>
<p><br />The day starts with an elephant ride to the Amer Fort for the   Hall of Public Audience, the Palace of Mirrors and other important   attractions. Reach early to avoid the huge crowd at the fort. If you   don\'t like to experience an Elephant ride, then a jeep can be arrnanged   to get up there on the hill fort.<br /><br />From here, head to the  City  Palace and appreciate its magnificent gardens and striking  courtyards.  They offer a brilliant contrast to the awe-inspiring  palatial  structures, such as the Shri Govind Dev temple, Badal Mahal,  Chandra  Mahal and Mubarak Mahal. Also, visit the Diwan-e-Khas and marvel  at the  giant silver water vessels. Jantar Mantar is the next  attraction. The  observatory comprises several impressive buildings of  distinctive  geometrical forms, each having a unique function for  astronomical  measurement. Hawa Mahal, the Palace of Winds, is a striking  attraction  with more than 900 windows.<br /><br />Later in the day, explore and indulge in shopping at the colourful bazaars of Jaipur.<br /><br /><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">INCLUDED</span>: Monument entrance fees, Elephant/Jeep ride, personal English-speaking guide &amp; private Chauffeur-driven vehicle<em><span style=\"text-decoration: line-through;\"><br /></span></em></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><em><br /></em></p>
                                )

